CORE
test.c
--nondet-volatile-write-model A:observe_A --nondet-volatile-write-model B:observe_B --mmio-weak --mmio-early-ack
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
A observed before B: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
--
Even under early acknowledgement, an ordering barrier (DMB) still orders posted
writes by generation: the write to A is observed before the write to B, so the
assertion holds. Compare noorder.desc, without the barrier.
